"Start Piik" = "启动 Piik";
"Open Piik in browser" = "在浏览器中打开 Piik";
"Open App page" = "打开 App 管理页";
"Stop Piik" = "停止 Piik";
"Start a session to use Piik in your browser. You can stop it here or in the system session controls." = "启动会话后，在浏览器中使用 Piik。你可以在这里或系统会话控件中停止它。";
"Waiting for the system to allow background execution…" = "正在等待系统允许后台运行…";
"Starting Piik…" = "正在启动 Piik…";
"Stopping Piik…" = "正在停止 Piik…";
"Piik is running. Rooms, camera and voice stay in your browser." = "Piik 正在运行。房间、摄像头和语音都在浏览器中使用。";
"Use the browser return button at the top of the screen to continue in the same tab." = "使用屏幕顶部的返回浏览器按钮，在原来的标签页中继续。";
"The system could not register this Piik session." = "系统未能注册本次 Piik 会话。";
"Starting your session" = "正在启动会话";
"Background execution is unavailable. Allow Background App Refresh for Piik, then try again." = "后台运行暂不可用。请允许 Piik 使用后台 App 刷新，然后重试。";
"The system ended this session. Start Piik again to reconnect." = "系统已结束本次会话。请重新启动 Piik 以连接。";
"Session active · %@" = "会话运行中 · %@";
"The browser could not open Piik. Start the session again to retry." = "浏览器未能打开 Piik。请重新启动会话后重试。";
